source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: Two backslashes hide the closer, so no span forms and the pair renders as a forced newline; jiro refuses the span too and keeps the legacy reading of one literal backslash.
